1
00:00:00,281 --> 00:00:03,146
Next, let's add the squash.

2
00:00:03,148 --> 00:00:04,304
Hey, what’s this?

3
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,516
Oh! Oh, we’ve got veggies!

4
00:00:08,375 --> 00:00:10,515
Perfect, this is super healthy!

5
00:00:10,523 --> 00:00:11,688
Right!

6
00:00:11,712 --> 00:00:14,059
I’m really going to cook pakbet,

7
00:00:14,068 --> 00:00:17,694
and I plan to add a lot of
shrimp paste so it tastes better!

8
00:00:17,709 --> 00:00:19,041
Grandma, no!

9
00:00:19,045 --> 00:00:20,113
Why?

10
00:00:20,131 --> 00:00:22,302
Grandma Maxi, did you forget?

11
00:00:22,318 --> 00:00:24,462
Tash is allergic to shrimp paste!

12
00:00:24,463 --> 00:00:26,111
Oh, that’s right!

13
00:00:26,119 --> 00:00:27,232
What?

14
00:00:27,236 --> 00:00:28,622
Tasha is allergic to shrimp paste?

15
00:00:28,627 --> 00:00:30,751
I heard that’s hereditary!
You know that?

16
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:34,168
Allergies like that run in families!
Which one of you has allergies?

17
00:00:34,179 --> 00:00:35,702
- None! Do you?
- No, none.

18
00:00:35,711 --> 00:00:37,247
- Allergy?
- Allergy?

19
00:00:37,250 --> 00:00:39,989
- Nope, none. I don’t have any allergies.
- Allergy?

20
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,067
They don’t have allergies.

21
00:00:41,070 --> 00:00:42,418
Ah!

22
00:00:42,442 --> 00:00:44,044
Did you know Tasha’s adopted?

23
00:00:44,048 --> 00:00:45,797
- Adopted?!
- That’s too much!

24
00:00:45,798 --> 00:00:47,790
What kind of adopted?

25
00:00:47,790 --> 00:00:51,928
I’m not! I even look like
my beauty queen mom!

26
00:00:51,931 --> 00:00:53,165
What are you saying?

27
00:00:53,170 --> 00:00:55,655
So, can we use that
coconut milk now?

28
00:00:55,670 --> 00:00:57,767
- That coconut milk.
- The coconut milk?

29
00:00:57,772 --> 00:00:59,159
- Coconut milk?
- Whoa, did you see that?

30
00:00:59,159 --> 00:01:02,329
This one’s better tasting
and doesn’t cause itchiness.

31
00:01:02,332 --> 00:01:03,519
- Ah!
- Oh, right!

32
00:01:03,530 --> 00:01:06,271
You want to use coconut milk
instead of shrimp paste!

33
00:01:06,287 --> 00:01:07,710
…instead of shrimp paste!

34
00:01:07,734 --> 00:01:10,428
Whose kid is this? So clever!

35
00:01:10,436 --> 00:01:11,710
- Right?!
- Right?!

36
00:02:14,687 --> 00:02:15,687
Ugh!

37
00:02:16,413 --> 00:02:18,202
The food here isn’t even good!

38
00:02:19,281 --> 00:02:21,764
Sis, it’s not good here.

39
00:02:21,765 --> 00:02:23,718
The taste is bitter!

40
00:02:23,734 --> 00:02:27,882
You know, the food is better and
cheaper across the street, at Bake K Nemen.

41
00:02:27,882 --> 00:02:29,163
It’s way better there!

42
00:02:29,163 --> 00:02:30,428
How about you?

43
00:02:30,429 --> 00:02:31,451
This food isn’t good at all!

44
00:02:31,452 --> 00:02:33,827
Look at that!
The color’s awful!

45
00:02:33,835 --> 00:02:36,436
Let’s go over there!
This isn’t tasty!

46
00:02:36,445 --> 00:02:38,359
My God! It looks terrible!

47
00:02:39,732 --> 00:02:40,919
Look at this!

48
00:02:40,919 --> 00:02:41,919
What is that?

49
00:02:42,503 --> 00:02:45,209
I knew it!

50
00:02:46,234 --> 00:02:48,568
I thought you already left
Barangay Singko?

51
00:02:49,324 --> 00:02:50,575
Why are you here again?

52
00:02:52,528 --> 00:02:53,638
Excuse me.

53
00:02:54,898 --> 00:02:59,684
A real villain doesn’t
back down from a fight.

54
00:03:01,007 --> 00:03:02,280
But you know what?

55
00:03:02,282 --> 00:03:03,984
Your cooking already gave up!

56
00:03:03,985 --> 00:03:06,399
The flavor surrendered.
It’s terrible!

57
00:03:06,399 --> 00:03:08,093
Excuse me?

58
00:03:08,094 --> 00:03:10,461
- Excuse you.
- My cooking tastes great!

59
00:03:10,469 --> 00:03:11,571
Says who?

60
00:03:11,579 --> 00:03:13,570
Everyone here in Barangay Singko!

61
00:03:13,570 --> 00:03:15,629
- Who’s that? Who said that?
- Then why are you back here again?

62
00:03:15,633 --> 00:03:16,864
Because I’m here and not there.

63
00:03:17,664 --> 00:03:20,009
- Kuya Je!
- That’s enough, that’s enough!

64
00:03:20,015 --> 00:03:22,045
You’re fighting again.

65
00:03:22,054 --> 00:03:23,503
Stop fighting, that’s enough.

66
00:03:23,507 --> 00:03:24,738
Stop it!

67
00:03:24,742 --> 00:03:27,172
Wait, wait...

68
00:03:27,179 --> 00:03:28,296
Yes? Why?

69
00:03:28,296 --> 00:03:29,444
What are you planning
to do with my bag?

70
00:03:29,453 --> 00:03:31,120
That thing’s already in there…

71
00:03:31,135 --> 00:03:32,955
- Hey, there still tomorrow.
- That’s my customer!

72
00:03:32,963 --> 00:03:34,615
- That’s my customer!
- No, that’s my customer!

73
00:03:34,619 --> 00:03:38,018
- Hello!
- Oh, hello! Hello there!

74
00:03:39,822 --> 00:03:40,930
Can I ask a question?

75
00:03:40,939 --> 00:03:42,675
- Yes, of course.
- What is it?

76
00:03:43,299 --> 00:03:44,966
Does someone named...

77
00:03:50,724 --> 00:03:51,724
Ha...

78
00:03:53,399 --> 00:03:54,399
Hannah live here?

79
00:03:55,418 --> 00:03:58,614
And a Tasha?

80
00:03:58,638 --> 00:04:00,059
Ah...

81
00:04:00,083 --> 00:04:01,708
And Ta-ta-Tasha?

82
00:04:01,716 --> 00:04:02,885
I’m Tash.

83
00:04:02,897 --> 00:04:04,467
I’m Hannah.

84
00:04:04,475 --> 00:04:05,704
Wait a second.

85
00:04:06,514 --> 00:04:08,114
I knew it!

86
00:04:09,108 --> 00:04:12,395
Hannah! Tasha! Right?

87
00:04:12,420 --> 00:04:13,970
Oh…

88
00:04:13,978 --> 00:04:15,294
Hannah,

89
00:04:15,298 --> 00:04:16,431
- Tasha.
- It’s a small thing,

90
00:04:16,439 --> 00:04:17,395
not a big deal.

91
00:04:17,400 --> 00:04:18,985
Who is that woman

92
00:04:18,994 --> 00:04:22,996
and how did she mix up
the names of our two leads?

93
00:04:23,595 --> 00:04:29,734
Find out in the next showdown
between Hannah and Tasha!

94
00:04:33,974 --> 00:04:36,183
Guys! Someone offered me
a modeling gig!

95
00:04:36,186 --> 00:04:37,353
- What?
- Yes!

96
00:04:37,358 --> 00:04:39,332
Really? Wow!

97
00:04:39,349 --> 00:04:41,490
Andres, wow,
you’re really famous now!

98
00:04:41,497 --> 00:04:43,957
You’ve changed!
You’re unreachable now!

99
00:04:43,966 --> 00:04:45,325
What the…

100
00:04:45,333 --> 00:04:47,988
- That’s amazing!
- What are you even saying?

101
00:04:47,993 --> 00:04:50,423
Andres is right here.
Totally reachable.

102
00:04:51,415 --> 00:04:53,337
- Right?
- God is really fair, right?

103
00:04:53,337 --> 00:04:55,061
So fair!

104
00:04:55,072 --> 00:04:57,030
You may be pretty,
but you’ve got no brains.

105
00:04:59,156 --> 00:05:00,334
- You know, Andres…
- What?

106
00:05:00,337 --> 00:05:01,635
…just take it.

107
00:05:01,641 --> 00:05:02,836
- But–
- Just take it!

108
00:05:02,844 --> 00:05:05,738
The problem is it has
a summer theme.

109
00:05:05,743 --> 00:05:07,608
- And I have to walk the runway!
- Oh?

110
00:05:07,618 --> 00:05:09,676
I don’t even know
how to do that kind of walk.

111
00:05:09,676 --> 00:05:10,676
You can do it!

112
00:05:10,692 --> 00:05:12,579
I just watched you last month!

113
00:05:12,583 --> 00:05:13,656
- Right!
- And another thing!

114
00:05:13,661 --> 00:05:15,315
I need to ask Anne if it’s okay.

115
00:05:16,016 --> 00:05:17,217
I need to visit her.

116
00:05:17,223 --> 00:05:19,529
You don’t need to ask
Anne for permission.

117
00:05:19,529 --> 00:05:20,529
Where were you?

118
00:05:20,537 --> 00:05:22,217
Where did you come from, Tso K?

119
00:05:22,224 --> 00:05:23,225
Where did you come from?

120
00:05:23,240 --> 00:05:25,802
I’ve been listening
this whole time. Okay?

121
00:05:25,808 --> 00:05:27,860
No need to ask for her permission.
I’ll handle Anne.

122
00:05:27,863 --> 00:05:29,205
- Really?
- Yes!

123
00:05:29,207 --> 00:05:31,296
- Oh, well then, alright!
- In case you didn’t know,

124
00:05:31,320 --> 00:05:34,167
I used to walk the summer runway!

125
00:05:34,176 --> 00:05:35,369
Oh!

126
00:05:35,379 --> 00:05:37,070
Runner-up, runner-up!

127
00:05:37,074 --> 00:05:38,872
See? I got you covered.

128
00:05:38,876 --> 00:05:40,501
- Alright.
- I used to model!

129
00:05:40,509 --> 00:05:43,892
- Really?
- Of course! Can’t you tell?

130
00:05:43,907 --> 00:05:45,009
Even if my legs
are a bit short now–

131
00:05:45,017 --> 00:05:46,446
Tso K, can you show me the…?

132
00:05:46,462 --> 00:05:49,599
Hey, in case you didn’t know,
I used to be long-legged!

133
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:52,319
I just got tired of it,
and shortened them a bit!

134
00:05:52,326 --> 00:05:54,087
What? You’re laughing so much!

135
00:05:54,091 --> 00:05:56,017
- I’m not joking!
- Nothing, nothing!

136
00:05:56,021 --> 00:05:57,685
From now on, I’m your trainer.

137
00:05:57,693 --> 00:05:59,192
- Okay, deal!
- I got you!

138
00:05:59,193 --> 00:06:00,872
- But…
- But what, Tso K?

139
00:06:00,880 --> 00:06:02,767
About the talent fee, okay?
We split it.

140
00:06:03,463 --> 00:06:04,516
Okay, deal.

141
00:06:04,523 --> 00:06:05,966
Tso K, wow, you’re really amazing.

142
00:06:05,984 --> 00:06:07,773
You don’t seem greedy
for money, right?

143
00:06:07,773 --> 00:06:08,875
- Of course not!
- No way, right?

144
00:06:08,890 --> 00:06:10,036
- Me?
- This is out of love?

145
00:06:10,047 --> 00:06:11,047
It’s not about the money for me.

146
00:06:11,058 --> 00:06:13,149
This is out of love,
out of love! Right?

147
00:06:13,156 --> 00:06:18,011
Right, left, right, left,
right, left, right, left. Boom!

148
00:06:18,685 --> 00:06:19,794
Look!

149
00:06:19,795 --> 00:06:20,989
Go!

150
00:06:21,013 --> 00:06:22,107
Look!

151
00:06:22,115 --> 00:06:23,250
Go!

152
00:06:23,255 --> 00:06:24,617
Pose!

153
00:06:28,655 --> 00:06:29,735
- You?!
- You?!

154
00:06:30,074 --> 00:06:31,633
Wait, you know each other?

155
00:06:31,636 --> 00:06:33,265
Oh no!

156
00:06:33,269 --> 00:06:34,737
He’s the former runner-up!

157
00:06:34,738 --> 00:06:37,798
I still don’t know how she
even placed runner-up!

158
00:06:37,803 --> 00:06:41,303
You were the cheating judge!

159
00:06:41,311 --> 00:06:43,903
Really?!

160
00:06:43,913 --> 00:06:46,206
Oh!

161
00:06:52,426 --> 00:06:54,232
- Ooh, hey, hey, hey!
- Oh, you!

162
00:06:54,238 --> 00:06:56,902
- Oh, what?! What?! What now?!
- Oh, oh, oh, that’s enough, enough!

163
00:06:56,910 --> 00:06:58,284
You even brought a fake nurse?!

164
00:06:58,285 --> 00:06:59,953
Hey, hey! You, watch
what you're saying!

165
00:06:59,957 --> 00:07:02,689
Maybe it’s you pulling off
some destabilization plot!

166
00:07:02,690 --> 00:07:04,980
Oh, so it’s a plot now?!
Fine! You want to see a plot?!

167
00:07:04,988 --> 00:07:08,015
Hey, hey, hey, hey!! Hey!

168
00:07:08,019 --> 00:07:09,418
Can you all calm down for a second?

169
00:07:09,425 --> 00:07:10,949
My head’s hurting
because of you all!

170
00:07:11,605 --> 00:07:14,792
Let’s listen first—
our guest Aling Legring is here.

171
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:16,706
Go ahead, Aling Legring!

172
00:07:16,714 --> 00:07:18,605
Do I look like an aling?

173
00:07:19,405 --> 00:07:20,874
It’s Nurse Legring.

174
00:07:21,897 --> 00:07:24,010
Nurse Legring, sorry.

175
00:07:24,020 --> 00:07:25,879
As I was saying—

176
00:07:25,887 --> 00:07:27,174
Yes, ma’am.

177
00:07:27,184 --> 00:07:29,458
I’m the nurse

178
00:07:29,473 --> 00:07:34,829
who assisted when Tash, and Hannah
were born at the same time!

179
00:07:35,612 --> 00:07:36,612
What?!

180
00:07:37,598 --> 00:07:39,250
Atasha and Hannah?!

181
00:07:39,788 --> 00:07:41,494
You were the nurse when they
were born at the same time?!

182
00:07:41,500 --> 00:07:43,172
- Uh-huh.
- How is that possible?

183
00:07:43,180 --> 00:07:45,180
She’s twenty-three,
and this one’s about to hit fifty?!

184
00:07:45,186 --> 00:07:47,443
- What?!
- That’s... that’s too much.

185
00:07:47,452 --> 00:07:49,841
That’s impossible,
they’re clearly not the same age!

186
00:07:49,842 --> 00:07:51,382
No, no—it’s not impossible!

187
00:07:51,390 --> 00:07:53,350
Their age gap is huge!

188
00:07:53,350 --> 00:07:55,275
- Look!
- That’s not impossible,

189
00:07:55,281 --> 00:07:56,894
Don’t say that!
Aunties and uncles,

190
00:07:56,895 --> 00:07:58,085
nothing is impossible!

191
00:07:58,093 --> 00:08:00,856
Look at this one!
Specimen number 3!

192
00:08:00,867 --> 00:08:03,050
Can you see that? Look, spin!

193
00:08:03,051 --> 00:08:04,836
- So what?
- I’m older than that one!

194
00:08:04,840 --> 00:08:06,119
But they aged faster!

195
00:08:07,393 --> 00:08:09,760
There it is…
but brand-new hair!

196
00:08:09,785 --> 00:08:13,285
Hey, what’s going on?!
You’re so loud!

197
00:08:13,293 --> 00:08:16,806
Oops! Lola! We’re sorry!
You heard us from there?!

198
00:08:16,819 --> 00:08:19,327
I’m on the fourth floor
and I can still hear you!

199
00:08:19,335 --> 00:08:22,483
I’m sorry, I’m sorry! We’re sorry!

200
00:08:22,491 --> 00:08:24,202
We have a fourth floor now.

201
00:08:24,211 --> 00:08:25,851
Lagring!

202
00:08:28,541 --> 00:08:30,495
Maxie!

203
00:08:30,500 --> 00:08:32,245
How have you been?

204
00:08:32,746 --> 00:08:35,576
Long time no see!
Come, sit down!

205
00:08:35,579 --> 00:08:37,038
- Oh!
- Lola Maxie,

206
00:08:37,048 --> 00:08:39,519
you really know each other?!

207
00:08:39,525 --> 00:08:40,728
What do you mean?

208
00:08:40,736 --> 00:08:42,256
Don’t you remember her?! –

209
00:08:42,267 --> 00:08:43,957
- Sit down!
- Okay.

210
00:08:43,960 --> 00:08:47,350
She’s the nurse who lived next door

211
00:08:47,359 --> 00:08:52,566
who helped deliver Tasha and Hannah
at the same time!

212
00:08:52,569 --> 00:08:53,793
Don’t you remember?!

213
00:08:53,818 --> 00:08:56,869
- Oh! That was you?!
- Yep, same time.

214
00:08:56,881 --> 00:08:58,857
Oh my! Hello.

215
00:08:58,881 --> 00:09:00,386
Hello.

216
00:09:00,391 --> 00:09:02,211
Why are you here?!

217
00:09:02,219 --> 00:09:06,609
Well, I’m about to retire.

218
00:09:06,609 --> 00:09:08,281
But there’s something I’ve been...

219
00:09:09,915 --> 00:09:13,699
carrying in my heart
for a long time.

220
00:09:13,707 --> 00:09:15,886
And I need to let it out.

221
00:09:15,903 --> 00:09:17,557
I need to reveal it.

222
00:09:17,568 --> 00:09:18,982
- Huh?! What is it?
- Oh, goodness!

223
00:09:18,983 --> 00:09:22,294
- Go on, Legring, tell us!
- Wasn’t I the nurse?!

224
00:09:22,295 --> 00:09:23,997
- You were!
- Yes!

225
00:09:26,190 --> 00:09:27,471
Uh–I think...

226
00:09:28,116 --> 00:09:30,303
I might’ve accidentally switched...

227
00:09:30,307 --> 00:09:34,250
- Switched what?!
- …Tasha and Hannah!

228
00:09:34,253 --> 00:09:35,575
- What?!
- What?!

229
00:09:54,450 --> 00:09:55,450
Andres,

230
00:09:56,407 --> 00:09:57,863
are you okay?

231
00:09:59,259 --> 00:10:02,144
I don’t think
I want to do this anymore.

232
00:10:02,150 --> 00:10:03,150
Huh?

233
00:10:03,165 --> 00:10:04,165
Well...

234
00:10:04,182 --> 00:10:06,298
I feel like I’m needed more at home.

235
00:10:06,986 --> 00:10:09,025
Especially now that
Tash is going through something.

236
00:10:10,602 --> 00:10:11,688
And if I’m going to do this,

237
00:10:11,696 --> 00:10:15,115
I’d rather have my girlfriend
as my partner.

238
00:10:15,118 --> 00:10:18,524
Oh no, Andres!

239
00:10:18,532 --> 00:10:20,368
That’s not allowed!

240
00:10:20,376 --> 00:10:21,988
The show must go on!

241
00:10:22,002 --> 00:10:27,603
You should be thinking about
your career opportunities!

242
00:10:27,616 --> 00:10:29,228
Not all this other nonsense!

243
00:10:31,993 --> 00:10:33,797
Hmm.. is it Andres’ opportunity?

244
00:10:33,805 --> 00:10:36,532
Or your opportunity
to get revenge?!

245
00:10:39,210 --> 00:10:40,539
- Are we late?!
- Oh!

246
00:10:42,689 --> 00:10:45,742
Hey! Watch your step! Careful!

247
00:10:45,751 --> 00:10:48,447
Move that over here!
Not there, here!

248
00:10:48,454 --> 00:10:49,454
What now?!

249
00:10:49,462 --> 00:10:51,964
- Sorry, sorry!
- We’re late!

250
00:10:51,973 --> 00:10:53,535
Are we too late?!

251
00:10:53,543 --> 00:10:55,137
Not really, but how’s Tash doing?

252
00:10:55,145 --> 00:10:57,418
Oh! It’s a huge problem!

253
00:10:57,418 --> 00:10:59,820
- No, he mean—
- Oh! It’s actually a huge relief!

254
00:10:59,824 --> 00:11:01,324
She’s doing fine, no problem.

255
00:11:01,332 --> 00:11:03,129
Everything’s good at home!

256
00:11:03,135 --> 00:11:05,107
- Chill, it’s all good!
- Everything’s just chill.

257
00:11:05,111 --> 00:11:06,474
Let’s get together!

258
00:11:06,478 --> 00:11:08,568
So you can see
what you’ll be wearing!

259
00:11:08,583 --> 00:11:09,583
Okay?!

260
00:11:10,470 --> 00:11:14,382
These are your outfits
for the runway!

261
00:11:14,391 --> 00:11:17,399
Right?! Just look at that! Wow!

262
00:11:17,407 --> 00:11:20,617
Designed by yours truly!!

263
00:11:20,626 --> 00:11:22,658
What exactly did you
design there?!

264
00:11:22,673 --> 00:11:24,044
The thread?

265
00:11:24,052 --> 00:11:26,019
Oh, stop butting in! Why?

266
00:11:26,020 --> 00:11:27,020
Look at this!

267
00:11:29,296 --> 00:11:31,336
Umm, excuse me Mrs. Maribetch.

268
00:11:33,881 --> 00:11:35,881
I was wondering if maybe
my girlfriend could be

269
00:11:35,890 --> 00:11:37,647
my partner for the runway,
if that’s okay?

270
00:11:37,647 --> 00:11:39,565
Mhmm? Oh, Ava! Ava!

271
00:11:40,552 --> 00:11:44,637
You’ll be her partner because
you two look perfect together!

272
00:11:45,519 --> 00:11:49,386
Ava, this is Andres!

273
00:11:49,393 --> 00:11:52,112
Andres, this is Ava!

274
00:11:52,119 --> 00:11:53,522
See? You’re a match!

275
00:11:53,534 --> 00:11:55,405
When you walk the runway together,

276
00:11:55,414 --> 00:12:00,196
it’s Mr. and Ms. Summer 2025! Go!

277
00:12:00,203 --> 00:12:02,039
Oh.. Sorry, wait, what–

278
00:12:02,047 --> 00:12:03,047
Andres!

279
00:12:03,047 --> 00:12:06,396
Don’t make Anne overthink!

280
00:12:06,407 --> 00:12:07,407
Why?

281
00:12:07,415 --> 00:12:09,411
Is there something she
should be worried about?!

282
00:12:09,415 --> 00:12:12,932
- Is there?!
- N-no sir! This is just work!

283
00:12:12,938 --> 00:12:14,049
I promise, it’s just work!

284
00:12:14,056 --> 00:12:15,056
Oh, see?

285
00:12:15,071 --> 00:12:17,409
Then there’s nothing
to worry about!

286
00:12:17,417 --> 00:12:19,739
Andres, come on!
et’s go change together!

287
00:12:20,519 --> 00:12:22,842
Ah, ah–ah! Excuse me!

288
00:12:22,847 --> 00:12:24,553
We’ll take care of him!

289
00:12:24,558 --> 00:12:25,558
Come on, Andres!

290
00:12:26,661 --> 00:12:28,081
Hold on a second, girl!

291
00:12:28,082 --> 00:12:29,715
I’ll take care of Andres.

292
00:12:29,717 --> 00:12:30,916
Just take the day off!

293
00:12:33,184 --> 00:12:34,500
You got benched!

294
00:12:34,512 --> 00:12:35,564
She just benched you!

295
00:12:35,566 --> 00:12:37,256
You got benched by her!

296
00:12:37,269 --> 00:12:38,269
Inday?!

297
00:12:39,088 --> 00:12:40,088
Day-off?!

298
00:12:40,808 --> 00:12:41,888
I’ll give her a—

299
00:12:41,913 --> 00:12:43,663
Don’t give her anything!
Just don’t!

300
00:12:44,197 --> 00:12:45,330
Mom, Dad, is it true?

301
00:12:46,320 --> 00:12:49,000
Atasha, of course not.

302
00:12:49,007 --> 00:12:52,173
You’re our daughter
and we’re sure of that!

303
00:12:52,695 --> 00:12:56,619
Don’t believe that Nurse Legring!

304
00:12:56,638 --> 00:12:58,779
She’s wrong!
What are you thinking?!

305
00:12:59,771 --> 00:13:04,350
So that’s why—I’m the only
one with seafood allergies!

306
00:13:05,568 --> 00:13:09,422
And you always say
I think differently.

307
00:13:10,601 --> 00:13:14,960
Turns out, it’s because I’m not
related to you by blood.

308
00:13:14,969 --> 00:13:18,820
Tasha, sweetie,
don’t think like that!

309
00:13:18,830 --> 00:13:20,322
You know what?

310
00:13:20,330 --> 00:13:23,440
Let’s do a DNA test
so we can be sure.

311
00:13:23,447 --> 00:13:24,720
- There you go!
- That’s right!

312
00:13:24,744 --> 00:13:26,005
So you can have peace of mind! –

313
00:13:26,006 --> 00:13:30,419
Oh, hello relatives, Helloooo!!

314
00:13:30,420 --> 00:13:32,945
Hello, mom, dad, grandma!

315
00:13:32,952 --> 00:13:34,910
- Oh, hi!
- Hannah?

316
00:13:35,701 --> 00:13:37,232
What are you doing here?

317
00:13:37,241 --> 00:13:39,482
Who... who even are you?!

318
00:13:39,506 --> 00:13:41,912
Correction! It’s Tash!

319
00:13:41,921 --> 00:13:46,592
It’s Tash dad! I’m the real Tash,
she’s Hannah!

320
00:13:46,600 --> 00:13:48,162
Okay, fine!

321
00:13:48,186 --> 00:13:50,634
You be the real Tash!
Go ahead!

322
00:13:50,642 --> 00:13:53,008
Oh really?! That’s right!
Go away fake Pers!

323
00:13:53,017 --> 00:13:54,467
Go! Get out!

324
00:13:54,480 --> 00:13:56,478
- Atasha!
- Tash!

325
00:13:56,486 --> 00:13:58,671
- Atasha!
- No no no, that’s me, that’s me!

326
00:13:58,680 --> 00:13:59,711
Keep calling my name!

327
00:13:59,711 --> 00:14:03,580
Oh mommy! Daddy!
Hello mommy!

328
00:14:03,604 --> 00:14:04,604
Mommy…

329
00:14:05,632 --> 00:14:06,719
Daddy…

330
00:14:07,509 --> 00:14:08,614
Come on, hold me!

331
00:14:08,626 --> 00:14:09,899
Hold me, mom!

332
00:14:09,907 --> 00:14:11,327
Hold me, mother!

333
00:14:11,337 --> 00:14:13,520
Oh mother knows best!

334
00:14:14,298 --> 00:14:15,324
Dad!

335
00:14:15,329 --> 00:14:17,790
Come on dad, come on!
Don’t be shy!

336
00:14:18,290 --> 00:14:19,459
Go Andres, go!

337
00:14:19,468 --> 00:14:21,382
Don’t forget what I told you!

338
00:14:21,389 --> 00:14:26,065
When you get to the end, pose
then strike a pose, pose, pose!

339
00:14:26,089 --> 00:14:28,395
Right there! Oh…

340
00:14:28,407 --> 00:14:30,406
There! Pose! Serve it! Serve it!

341
00:14:30,430 --> 00:14:33,148
Work it! Work it right there!

342
00:14:33,172 --> 00:14:35,374
What? You’re cold?!

343
00:14:35,375 --> 00:14:37,883
What’s going on with you?

344
00:14:37,892 --> 00:14:40,508
Tso K, I can’t.
I really can’t do this, Tso K!

345
00:14:40,533 --> 00:14:42,266
Anne might even get mad at me!

346
00:14:42,274 --> 00:14:43,602
Oh, you really can’t do it?!

347
00:14:43,626 --> 00:14:45,920
Then if you can’t—Tso K,
if he can’t, I’ll do it!

348
00:14:45,945 --> 00:14:48,354
I’ll be the proxy!
I’m even better looking!

349
00:14:48,354 --> 00:14:49,832
You’re not part of this!

350
00:14:49,833 --> 00:14:52,325
Hey hey hey, wait!
Hold up! No proxies allowed!

351
00:14:52,333 --> 00:14:53,442
No proxies allowed?!

352
00:14:53,443 --> 00:14:55,040
- What should I do, Tso K?
- Listen to me!

353
00:14:55,048 --> 00:14:56,637
- Okay.
- Just focus! Alright?!

354
00:14:56,642 --> 00:14:59,634
Are you really gonna let
Ava and Maribetch beat you?!

355
00:14:59,642 --> 00:15:01,276
- Exactly!
- That’s right!

356
00:15:01,290 --> 00:15:02,935
Come on, you got this!
Go, go, go!

357
00:15:02,939 --> 00:15:03,939
Go, go, go!

358
00:15:03,940 --> 00:15:06,005
Oh! Hey! Oh my god!

359
00:15:06,012 --> 00:15:08,173
Oh my–you got this! Andres!

360
00:15:08,186 --> 00:15:09,186
Andres!

361
00:15:10,006 --> 00:15:10,986
Oh my goodness!

362
00:15:10,998 --> 00:15:13,012
That’s exactly what
I said would happen!

363
00:15:13,014 --> 00:15:17,826
Because his coach
is just a runner-up!

364
00:15:17,851 --> 00:15:19,786
What does he even know?!

365
00:15:19,787 --> 00:15:20,840
Oh come on!

366
00:15:20,848 --> 00:15:23,171
Sounds like you're
jinxing it or something!

367
00:15:23,184 --> 00:15:24,991
- Like you wanted that to happen!
- Exactly!

368
00:15:24,996 --> 00:15:26,904
Well you are just a runner-up,
aren’t you?!

369
00:15:26,918 --> 00:15:28,537
You’re lucky you
even placed runner-up!

370
00:15:28,543 --> 00:15:30,871
You don’t know anything
about this whole runway thing!

371
00:15:31,668 --> 00:15:36,007
- Showdown! Showdown!
- She cheated! She cheated me!

372
00:15:36,012 --> 00:15:37,121
Let me show you how it’s done!

373
00:15:37,129 --> 00:15:38,646
There you go!

374
00:15:39,991 --> 00:15:47,079
Walk this way,
you turn, and stop!

375
00:15:47,083 --> 00:15:48,748
And go!

376
00:15:48,754 --> 00:15:49,871
And stop!

377
00:15:49,879 --> 00:15:51,272
And walk again!

378
00:15:53,378 --> 00:15:54,461
That’s not allowed!

379
00:15:54,465 --> 00:15:56,831
I’m really getting
worked up over here!

380
00:15:56,838 --> 00:15:58,331
I don’t want to
stoop to that level!

381
00:15:58,338 --> 00:15:59,671
I don’t want to stoop to that level!

382
00:15:59,690 --> 00:16:01,696
But you’re really getting
on my nerves—ugh!

383
00:16:02,712 --> 00:16:05,925
I really don’t want to stoop down,
but you’re so annoying!

384
00:16:06,655 --> 00:16:07,749
That’s it!

385
00:16:07,757 --> 00:16:09,101
Tso K! Tso K!

386
00:16:25,964 --> 00:16:28,761
This is your fault, Lagring!

387
00:16:28,769 --> 00:16:31,390
If you didn’t spread gossip!

388
00:16:31,394 --> 00:16:32,925
What gossip?!

389
00:16:32,949 --> 00:16:34,182
That!

390
00:16:34,191 --> 00:16:36,409
About the babies being switched!

391
00:16:36,417 --> 00:16:38,139
Well I’m sure about it!

392
00:16:38,144 --> 00:16:41,634
Deep in my heart… it’s real…

393
00:16:42,929 --> 00:16:45,124
I really can’t do
anything anymore!

394
00:16:45,136 --> 00:16:47,473
I already told you!

395
00:16:47,484 --> 00:16:50,109
I think I should just
take this to the lab.

396
00:16:50,128 --> 00:16:51,689
Oh! Okay.

397
00:16:51,705 --> 00:16:53,846
Thank you so much, Nurse Lagring!

398
00:16:56,642 --> 00:16:57,642
Take care.

399
00:17:02,689 --> 00:17:03,689
Lola Maxie…

400
00:17:06,125 --> 00:17:10,129
Nurse Lagring was wearing gloves,
she didn’t take them off!

401
00:17:10,142 --> 00:17:13,029
Maybe she’s using
them for driving?

402
00:17:14,317 --> 00:17:15,317
Dad…

403
00:17:15,342 --> 00:17:16,608
- Yes, Andres?
- Mom…

404
00:17:18,013 --> 00:17:20,639
I kind of feel worried for Tash,

405
00:17:20,654 --> 00:17:24,477
because I also feel sorry for
what she’s going through now.

406
00:17:26,545 --> 00:17:28,381
Andres, don’t
worry about Atasha!

407
00:17:29,045 --> 00:17:31,392
We’re more concerned about you!

408
00:17:31,404 --> 00:17:33,595
Are you going through something?

409
00:17:33,599 --> 00:17:34,853
Are you okay?

410
00:17:36,029 --> 00:17:37,260
- Nothing?
- Nothing!

411
00:17:37,279 --> 00:17:39,020
- Are you okay?
- Yeah!

412
00:17:39,025 --> 00:17:40,094
Okay?

413
00:17:40,095 --> 00:17:41,537
Kuya!

414
00:17:41,540 --> 00:17:43,495
Come here, you sit next to me!

415
00:17:43,501 --> 00:17:44,712
- Kuya?
- Yes.

416
00:17:44,720 --> 00:17:45,943
There, she said sit next to her!

417
00:17:45,962 --> 00:17:47,943
C’mon! Is anyone else here?
No, right?!

418
00:17:47,951 --> 00:17:49,576
It’s you! C’mon, sit down!

419
00:17:50,487 --> 00:17:52,137
We need to bond!

420
00:17:53,615 --> 00:17:55,761
We need to smell each other!

421
00:17:55,764 --> 00:17:58,935
Let me see—ooh, it’s my brother!

422
00:17:58,939 --> 00:18:00,103
Let me see, let me see!

423
00:18:02,286 --> 00:18:04,072
It’s very nice!
We need to bond!

424
00:18:04,079 --> 00:18:07,119
Turns out I’m a fake, kuya!

425
00:18:07,126 --> 00:18:08,882
- A fake Pers!
- Tasha!

426
00:18:08,884 --> 00:18:10,423
Tash, that’s not true!

427
00:18:10,439 --> 00:18:13,192
You’re my sister,
don’t believe any of that, okay?

428
00:18:15,004 --> 00:18:16,996
It’s scary!

429
00:18:17,004 --> 00:18:18,297
Don’t be sad!

430
00:18:18,309 --> 00:18:20,867
We’re sure you’re a real Pers!

431
00:18:20,871 --> 00:18:21,871
Right, guys?!

432
00:18:21,893 --> 00:18:23,390
Yeah! So, so true!

433
00:18:23,391 --> 00:18:25,692
But, but, but...

434
00:18:25,699 --> 00:18:28,715
Nurse Lagring did seem
pretty sketchy, right?

435
00:18:28,723 --> 00:18:29,876
But it’s possible too!

436
00:18:32,619 --> 00:18:34,799
- There goes Osang again!
- I was just saying!

437
00:18:34,809 --> 00:18:36,363
You always want to be
the center of attention!

438
00:18:36,371 --> 00:18:37,472
You know what?

439
00:18:37,488 --> 00:18:38,754
You’re just too negative!

440
00:18:38,762 --> 00:18:41,521
I strongly believe
you’re a real Pers! Why?

441
00:18:41,527 --> 00:18:44,023
Just look at that beauty!

442
00:18:44,031 --> 00:18:45,064
That’s Pers-level beauty!

443
00:18:45,069 --> 00:18:47,560
Not for Shokey! Shokey?!

444
00:18:48,881 --> 00:18:51,464
Hey! What did you just say?!

445
00:18:52,528 --> 00:18:54,475
Not Shokey, okay?! Tso K!

446
00:18:54,483 --> 00:18:56,549
- Tso K, Tso K.
- Okay.

447
00:18:56,553 --> 00:18:59,372
Tash, don’t overthink!

448
00:19:00,076 --> 00:19:03,029
What you should do
is wait for the result!

449
00:19:03,996 --> 00:19:05,745
But I promise you,

450
00:19:05,753 --> 00:19:08,890
even if you turn out to be
Aga’s daughter or my niece,

451
00:19:10,122 --> 00:19:12,291
I promise I’ll still love you!

452
00:19:12,296 --> 00:19:14,562
- Aww!
- Really, Tso K?!

453
00:19:15,624 --> 00:19:16,624
Of course!

454
00:19:17,243 --> 00:19:21,570
But let’s say you
really are my niece,

455
00:19:21,577 --> 00:19:25,160
then I’ll have to teach
you Anti-Pers 101!

456
00:19:25,161 --> 00:19:27,300
Anti-Pers? What’s that?

457
00:19:27,316 --> 00:19:30,026
Okay here’s how it works—
let’s say you’re Aga, right?

458
00:19:30,036 --> 00:19:31,546
Then I see you and say—

459
00:19:31,552 --> 00:19:32,629
BFF!!

460
00:19:32,645 --> 00:19:35,857
When are you going
to pay me back?!

461
00:19:35,857 --> 00:19:37,759
- What will you do?
- Uh,

462
00:19:38,911 --> 00:19:40,079
Bestie!

463
00:19:41,709 --> 00:19:43,592
Can I pay next week?

464
00:19:43,593 --> 00:19:45,001
Why does your
voice sound like that?

465
00:19:45,797 --> 00:19:47,772
Why’d it suddenly change?
What’s with you?

466
00:19:47,774 --> 00:19:49,633
- See, that’s wrong already!
- How?

467
00:19:49,641 --> 00:19:52,358
Do it slowly, like your dad
does when I say that,

468
00:19:52,365 --> 00:19:54,570
he slowly puts his
arm around me–

469
00:19:54,579 --> 00:19:58,434
Like this, slowly! There!

470
00:19:58,442 --> 00:20:01,003
Then like this, then like that, right?

471
00:20:01,020 --> 00:20:02,536
It leads to this!

472
00:20:02,551 --> 00:20:04,160
Then there you go!

473
00:20:04,169 --> 00:20:06,005
So are you going to pay me now?

474
00:20:07,504 --> 00:20:10,690
Uh, BFF, next week, promise!

475
00:20:10,700 --> 00:20:12,011
Next week?! No way!

476
00:20:12,020 --> 00:20:14,473
I need it now! I don’t want—

477
00:20:14,481 --> 00:20:16,028
Don’t be like that!

478
00:20:16,036 --> 00:20:19,494
It’s okay, BFF! It’s okay, BFF!

479
00:20:19,505 --> 00:20:21,820
Hey, you’re just like your dad!

480
00:20:23,522 --> 00:20:25,877
When he does that to me,
I don’t get it!

481
00:20:25,883 --> 00:20:27,327
What is up with that?!

482
00:20:37,664 --> 00:20:40,051
Hey, why is it just you guys?!

483
00:20:40,054 --> 00:20:41,538
Go invite more people, quick!

484
00:20:42,756 --> 00:20:43,756
Go on!

485
00:20:44,803 --> 00:20:45,945
Want some cake?

486
00:20:45,946 --> 00:20:47,222
It’s really good!

487
00:20:47,226 --> 00:20:48,781
Tastes good, right?!

488
00:20:50,262 --> 00:20:51,917
Oh, hi Daddy!

489
00:20:53,917 --> 00:20:55,410
- Mommy!
- What is this?!

490
00:20:55,434 --> 00:20:56,434
Lola.

491
00:20:57,825 --> 00:21:01,360
Wait a minute—sorry,

492
00:21:01,903 --> 00:21:03,231
but this is…

493
00:21:03,239 --> 00:21:05,697
this is getting too much, Hannah!

494
00:21:06,732 --> 00:21:08,200
Tash, Dad!

495
00:21:08,693 --> 00:21:10,737
Remember, we switched!

496
00:21:10,742 --> 00:21:12,748
I’m Tash! Tasha!

497
00:21:12,748 --> 00:21:16,297
Oh dear, don’t get too
ahead of yourself, okay?

498
00:21:16,975 --> 00:21:20,112
That’s why we’re doing a DNA test.

499
00:21:20,123 --> 00:21:21,713
I mean, for me—

500
00:21:21,714 --> 00:21:24,535
there’s no way I have a
granddaughter who looks like a witch!

501
00:21:24,559 --> 00:21:25,851
Exactly!

502
00:21:25,868 --> 00:21:30,464
And before we start
assuming things like this,

503
00:21:30,479 --> 00:21:35,727
we just want to be sure!
So no one gets hurt!

504
00:21:47,590 --> 00:21:50,723
Why are you doing this to me?

505
00:21:51,400 --> 00:21:53,005
Why?

506
00:21:53,028 --> 00:22:00,830
My own mother, father,
and grandmother?!

507
00:22:00,854 --> 00:22:02,741
Why are you treating me this way?

508
00:22:02,744 --> 00:22:05,157
I didn’t do anything wrong!

509
00:22:06,001 --> 00:22:07,836
What are we supposed to do now?

510
00:22:07,847 --> 00:22:09,962
Look, people are staring at us!

511
00:22:09,964 --> 00:22:11,121
- So embarrassing!
- So embarrassing!

512
00:22:11,146 --> 00:22:15,581
- What are we going to do?!
- Like this! I know the blocking!

513
00:22:15,589 --> 00:22:18,198
- Huh?
- Daddy stands here,

514
00:22:19,933 --> 00:22:22,274
and Mommy here!

515
00:22:25,387 --> 00:22:26,887
Like that.

516
00:22:26,895 --> 00:22:28,054
And hug!

517
00:22:31,490 --> 00:22:33,043
I love you daddy!

518
00:22:34,497 --> 00:22:36,297
I love you mommy!

519
00:22:37,546 --> 00:22:39,221
Hug!

520
00:22:39,229 --> 00:22:40,272
Hug!

521
00:22:40,276 --> 00:22:42,239
I love you so much!

522
00:22:42,245 --> 00:22:44,364
I love you, too!

523
00:22:44,388 --> 00:22:51,370
I love you, mommy!
I love you daddy!

524
00:22:51,373 --> 00:22:53,272
You love me!!!

525
00:22:55,845 --> 00:22:56,852
Hug!

526
00:22:56,876 --> 00:22:58,611
We love each other!

527
00:22:58,635 --> 00:22:59,846
We’re a family!

528
00:22:59,847 --> 00:23:02,126
We look alike!

529
00:23:02,150 --> 00:23:04,583
I love you, you love me!

530
00:23:06,087 --> 00:23:07,901
And lola loves me too!

531
00:23:09,292 --> 00:23:10,292
What is this?!

532
00:23:10,620 --> 00:23:12,424
Nurse Lagring is taking forever!

533
00:23:13,394 --> 00:23:16,095
Don’t worry, she’ll get here soon!

534
00:23:16,107 --> 00:23:17,463
Oh, there she is!

535
00:23:23,807 --> 00:23:26,143
Oh, what’s that?!

536
00:23:26,168 --> 00:23:29,666
Tash! Where are you going?!

537
00:23:29,668 --> 00:23:31,534
- Yeah.
- I’m leaving.

538
00:23:32,306 --> 00:23:34,280
I’ll just go back to Singapore.

539
00:23:34,285 --> 00:23:37,216
Wait a second—
why so much stuff?!

540
00:23:37,227 --> 00:23:42,430
Tash, listen, just relax because
Nurse Lagring is almost here!

541
00:23:42,438 --> 00:23:44,990
That’s when everything
will be cleared up!

542
00:23:45,497 --> 00:23:46,725
That’s just it, Mom.

543
00:23:47,196 --> 00:23:51,232
What if the DNA result
says I’m not your daughter?

544
00:23:51,241 --> 00:23:53,232
That’s impossible, Atasha!

545
00:23:53,241 --> 00:23:55,601
- Excuse me!
- Oh great, here comes another one!

546
00:23:56,602 --> 00:23:59,305
- What?!
- Mom! Dad!

547
00:24:00,312 --> 00:24:02,519
Come on, just let her go!

548
00:24:02,530 --> 00:24:03,530
Let her be!

549
00:24:03,546 --> 00:24:07,785
She needs to leave
because I am the real Pers!

550
00:24:07,809 --> 00:24:09,794
I’m the real Tasha!

551
00:24:09,818 --> 00:24:10,991
Because hello?!

552
00:24:10,995 --> 00:24:16,740
We’re the real family here,
I mean, look at us!

553
00:24:16,764 --> 00:24:18,330
I belong to this family!

554
00:24:18,354 --> 00:24:20,951
Not like Tso K’s family!

555
00:24:20,975 --> 00:24:21,975
Those are like—

556
00:24:21,982 --> 00:24:22,991
What?!

557
00:24:23,015 --> 00:24:25,481
Go on, finish it! Finish it!

558
00:24:25,482 --> 00:24:32,037
If you’re not the real Pers,
you’ll be my first eviction!

559
00:24:33,848 --> 00:24:36,277
Sma—Smart people!

560
00:24:36,286 --> 00:24:37,455
You thought—

561
00:24:37,473 --> 00:24:38,666
You know what, Tash,

562
00:24:39,689 --> 00:24:41,249
what I learned today...

563
00:24:42,082 --> 00:24:43,876
is that insecurity and jealousy,

564
00:24:46,108 --> 00:24:52,693
come from the fear of losing
something or someone, okay?

565
00:24:53,859 --> 00:24:54,906
You get that.

566
00:24:56,631 --> 00:25:04,671
But what truly matters in a
person is trust, respect, and love—

567
00:25:04,678 --> 00:25:08,644
those things you can’t
just replace easily!

568
00:25:08,668 --> 00:25:11,436
Wow! Deep stuff!

569
00:25:11,452 --> 00:25:12,720
Very good, bro!

570
00:25:14,483 --> 00:25:16,291
- What’s your name?!
- There she is!

571
00:25:16,296 --> 00:25:17,874
- What’s your name?
- Goms.

572
00:25:17,898 --> 00:25:19,418
- Goms?!
- Yes.

573
00:25:21,351 --> 00:25:23,247
You’re always grabbing this!

574
00:25:23,249 --> 00:25:25,968
Oh! Oh! Lagring!

575
00:25:30,398 --> 00:25:31,926
- You’re finally here!
- Yes!

576
00:25:31,937 --> 00:25:33,526
Let’s find out the result!

577
00:25:33,530 --> 00:25:35,263
Oh my gosh! Oh my gosh! Oh my gosh!

578
00:25:35,288 --> 00:25:37,107
Oh my gosh! Oh my gosh! Dad!

579
00:25:37,109 --> 00:25:38,109
Okay, okay, okay.

580
00:25:40,005 --> 00:25:41,473
I’m so excited, mom, dad!

581
00:25:44,027 --> 00:25:48,647
- So I don’t make a mistake!
- Yes, yes, that’s it! That’s it!

582
00:25:49,615 --> 00:25:50,655
It’s upside down.

583
00:25:50,659 --> 00:25:52,050
Alright, go on!

584
00:25:55,417 --> 00:25:56,843
Based on the result…

585
00:25:56,847 --> 00:26:00,037
- Here it comes!
- Ooh, results!

586
00:26:00,050 --> 00:26:16,454
99.999% the real child of Aga…
and it’s none other than…

587
00:26:16,478 --> 00:26:17,836
Oh my gosh! Oh my gosh!

588
00:26:17,860 --> 00:26:20,245
- Here we go!
- Hold on, hold on, wait.

589
00:26:21,242 --> 00:26:23,370
- Sorry, sorry…
- There's a call.

590
00:26:23,394 --> 00:26:24,394
- Call?
- Hello?!

591
00:26:24,406 --> 00:26:25,584
Someone called?

592
00:26:26,382 --> 00:26:28,019
What are you doing there?!

593
00:26:28,039 --> 00:26:29,321
In Bataan?!

594
00:26:30,011 --> 00:26:31,557
Why are you there?

595
00:26:32,296 --> 00:26:34,013
Okay, fine!

596
00:26:34,017 --> 00:26:35,924
Here we go, here we go!

597
00:26:35,949 --> 00:26:39,532
Again again again again!
Mom, Dad, Mom, Dad!

598
00:26:42,815 --> 00:26:44,655
The real child

599
00:26:45,645 --> 00:26:52,172
of Aga and it’s none other than…

600
00:26:52,197 --> 00:26:54,290
- Who?!
- Come on! Who?!

601
00:26:55,767 --> 00:26:57,492
Oh come on! What now?!

602
00:26:57,516 --> 00:26:59,251
That call!

603
00:26:59,251 --> 00:27:01,129
Another call!

604
00:27:01,142 --> 00:27:02,597
I’ll just answer it.

605
00:27:02,618 --> 00:27:04,589
Go ahead, go ahead! Answer it!

606
00:27:04,603 --> 00:27:05,691
Hello?!

607
00:27:06,783 --> 00:27:09,361
Oh, you’re in Zambales already?!

608
00:27:10,329 --> 00:27:12,633
- That was fast!
- That was fast!

609
00:27:12,657 --> 00:27:14,466
It’s only been a few minutes?!

610
00:27:15,624 --> 00:27:17,435
Later, okay?

611
00:27:17,445 --> 00:27:19,509
Someone’s waiting here!

612
00:27:19,515 --> 00:27:20,782
Okay, bye!

613
00:27:20,796 --> 00:27:22,050
Who was that?
Is that her boyfriend?

614
00:27:22,054 --> 00:27:24,302
- Here it is, sorry.
- It’s okay, it’s okay!

615
00:27:24,303 --> 00:27:28,208
Oh my gosh! Oh my gosh!
Oh my gosh! Oh my gosh! Again!

616
00:27:28,209 --> 00:27:29,269
This is it, this is it!

617
00:27:29,271 --> 00:27:35,531
The real child of Aga
and it’s none other than…

618
00:27:35,556 --> 00:27:37,255
- Who?!
- Who?!

619
00:27:40,859 --> 00:27:42,892
- What?!
- She threw it!

620
00:27:42,899 --> 00:27:45,890
Who? Who? Who?
Just say it! I’m going crazy!

621
00:27:45,906 --> 00:27:47,130
Here it is, here it is!

622
00:27:47,155 --> 00:27:48,155
Tasha!

623
00:27:49,060 --> 00:27:50,986
Hey! It’s me!

624
00:27:51,006 --> 00:27:57,610
It’s really me!
Mom, Dad, it’s really me!

625
00:27:58,977 --> 00:27:59,977
What now?

626
00:28:02,412 --> 00:28:04,016
Wasn’t it me?! It’s me!

627
00:28:04,021 --> 00:28:07,452
It’s not you! Tasha, it’s her!

628
00:28:07,459 --> 00:28:08,459
There it is!

629
00:28:12,524 --> 00:28:14,511
Wait a second! Tash!

630
00:28:14,519 --> 00:28:15,639
Reunited!

631
00:28:15,652 --> 00:28:18,196
See! That’s what I’ve been saying!

632
00:28:18,207 --> 00:28:19,900
Right, Atasha!

633
00:28:19,915 --> 00:28:21,333
Talk to her!

634
00:28:21,978 --> 00:28:25,314
You really are our true daughter!

635
00:28:25,329 --> 00:28:26,329
Right?!

636
00:28:27,010 --> 00:28:29,524
We keep telling you that
over and over!

637
00:28:29,548 --> 00:28:30,634
We love you so much!

638
00:28:31,273 --> 00:28:36,248
Atasha, when did you ever
doubt that I’m your dad?

639
00:28:37,208 --> 00:28:40,094
Look at your eyes,
look at your body!

640
00:28:40,118 --> 00:28:41,544
You got all that from me!

641
00:28:42,002 --> 00:28:43,002
That’s right!

642
00:28:44,556 --> 00:28:46,587
- See?!
- Told you, Dad!

643
00:28:47,893 --> 00:28:48,994
This can’t be.

644
00:28:49,002 --> 00:28:50,772
This really can’t be!

645
00:28:50,784 --> 00:28:53,265
This isn’t over, Tasha!

646
00:28:53,266 --> 00:28:56,047
This is not the end of it—
not if I can help it!

647
00:28:58,437 --> 00:28:59,444
Remember M,

648
00:29:00,141 --> 00:29:01,373
remember E,

649
00:29:01,861 --> 00:29:03,433
put them together…

650
00:29:04,409 --> 00:29:06,211
Remember me!

651
00:29:07,879 --> 00:29:08,879
Hey…

652
00:29:09,517 --> 00:29:10,816
I love you, Tso K!

653
00:29:11,858 --> 00:29:13,334
What do you mean
“love you too, love you too”?!

654
00:29:13,335 --> 00:29:14,335
Ugh!

655
00:29:15,721 --> 00:29:17,323
You were the one
chasing after me!

656
00:29:17,324 --> 00:29:20,825
Now! I’m the one chasing after you!

657
00:29:20,840 --> 00:29:21,840
Hmp!

658
00:29:22,576 --> 00:29:23,786
You're so annoying!

659
00:29:23,802 --> 00:29:25,330
Ha! But you're so handsome!

660
00:29:25,333 --> 00:29:26,455
What?!

661
00:29:26,466 --> 00:29:29,634
I mean... you're just so annoying!

662
00:29:29,638 --> 00:29:31,231
Because Anne won’t
be able to make it!

663
00:29:32,104 --> 00:29:34,540
Huh?! Why not?!

664
00:29:34,551 --> 00:29:37,151
But Tso K, she promised
she’d come watch!

665
00:29:37,160 --> 00:29:39,777
Exactly, but her stomach acted up.

666
00:29:39,785 --> 00:29:42,191
Oh no, Tso K, I don’t want
to do this without Anne!

667
00:29:42,207 --> 00:29:45,535
What if she gets mad when
she finds out Ava is my partner?

668
00:29:45,559 --> 00:29:47,247
You know what, Andres?

669
00:29:47,260 --> 00:29:51,004
If there’s nothing to be jealous about,
you shouldn’t be worried!

670
00:29:51,018 --> 00:29:53,702
- There you go! Exactly!
- True! True, true, true!

671
00:29:53,726 --> 00:30:00,265
A relationship is built on trust,
not jealousy!

672
00:30:00,269 --> 00:30:01,366
Correct!

673
00:30:01,382 --> 00:30:06,809
Well, if you guys are okay with it and
Anne’s okay with it, then sure, why not?!

674
00:30:06,833 --> 00:30:09,411
- Totally sure!
- Absolutely sure!

675
00:30:09,435 --> 00:30:12,321
Alright, alright, let’s do this!
Break a leg!

676
00:30:12,337 --> 00:30:13,337
As long as Anne’s okay with it!

677
00:30:13,345 --> 00:30:14,345
- Sure!
- Yeah!

678
00:30:14,350 --> 00:30:16,267
Break a leg, break a leg!

679
00:30:16,275 --> 00:30:17,595
Andres, are you ready?!

680
00:30:17,611 --> 00:30:18,611
Yes!

681
00:30:20,018 --> 00:30:21,412
- Let’s go, babe!
- Okay.

682
00:30:23,228 --> 00:30:27,374
Ladies and gentlemen!

683
00:30:28,871 --> 00:30:33,834
Fashion lovers, trendsetters,

684
00:30:33,859 --> 00:30:39,866
welcome to the hot,
and sizzling barangay Singko!

685
00:30:39,883 --> 00:30:41,840
A round of applause!

686
00:30:43,642 --> 00:30:48,580
Let’s give a big round, round,
round, round of applause

687
00:30:48,596 --> 00:30:53,051
for our one and only organizer…

688
00:30:53,056 --> 00:30:59,171
Ms. Rampa Sa Tag-Init 1989!

689
00:31:00,358 --> 00:31:04,804
Ms. Maribetch!

690
00:31:04,829 --> 00:31:08,428
Hello, everyone!
Good afternoon to all of you!

691
00:31:08,435 --> 00:31:11,325
I know you’re all super
excited to see this.

692
00:31:11,333 --> 00:31:13,046
So let’s not keep you waiting!

693
00:31:13,070 --> 00:31:19,888
Let us all welcome our
Brgy. Singko Rampa Sa Tag-Init 2025!

694
00:31:30,221 --> 00:31:31,221
Go!

695
00:31:31,229 --> 00:31:32,333
Wow!

696
00:31:32,338 --> 00:31:33,358
Yeah!

697
00:31:36,956 --> 00:31:37,956
Wow!

698
00:31:43,498 --> 00:31:45,278
Let’s go, let’s go, let’s go!

699
00:33:02,081 --> 00:33:03,081
Go, bro!

700
00:33:10,679 --> 00:33:13,940
Excuse me, I’d like to
buy some… ice cream!

701
00:33:17,039 --> 00:33:22,467
And now, let’s give a big round,
round, round, round of applause

702
00:33:22,477 --> 00:33:31,207
to our fashion designer–
Ms. Maribetch!

703
00:33:32,669 --> 00:33:34,355
Thank you, ladies! Thank you!

704
00:33:36,566 --> 00:33:37,815
This is it!

705
00:33:37,825 --> 00:33:40,348
Raise the flag of Barangay Singko!

706
00:33:40,356 --> 00:33:42,759
Knock that Ava out of the water!

707
00:33:42,762 --> 00:33:45,823
Hmp! Maribetch, get ready!

708
00:33:45,837 --> 00:33:47,844
This is my revenge on you!

709
00:33:47,860 --> 00:33:49,070
Hmp! Do your best!

710
00:33:49,078 --> 00:33:50,124
Leave it to me, Tso K!

711
00:33:50,125 --> 00:33:51,930
Alright! Get ready.

712
00:33:51,938 --> 00:33:56,383
And let’s give a big round,
round, round of applause

713
00:33:56,391 --> 00:33:58,946
to our main stars for tonight!

714
00:33:58,954 --> 00:34:04,281
- Wow!
- Our king and queen of Barangay Singko!

715
00:34:04,305 --> 00:34:07,579
None other than…

716
00:34:09,080 --> 00:34:13,651
Andres and Ava!

717
00:34:26,091 --> 00:34:27,684
One more time, one more time!

718
00:34:40,278 --> 00:34:41,980
Stop the music!

719
00:34:43,214 --> 00:34:44,214
Huh?!

720
00:34:44,941 --> 00:34:47,261
How dare you steal my spotlight!

721
00:34:47,269 --> 00:34:48,269
Yeah, and so?!

722
00:34:49,721 --> 00:34:51,625
Who are you to ruin my show?!

723
00:34:51,641 --> 00:34:52,724
Take this!

724
00:34:53,873 --> 00:34:54,873
Stop it!

725
00:34:55,868 --> 00:34:58,563
This is my show!

726
00:34:58,572 --> 00:34:59,998
So get out!

727
00:35:05,932 --> 00:35:07,806
And the winner is,

728
00:35:08,424 --> 00:35:09,708
for our

729
00:35:10,596 --> 00:35:13,482
Barangay Singko
Rampa sa Tag-Init 2025…

730
00:35:13,486 --> 00:35:16,314
Andres and Osang!!

731
00:35:38,136 --> 00:35:42,213
Tomorrow is the auditions
for the 2025 Queen of Sagala!

732
00:35:42,229 --> 00:35:43,908
I kinda want to audition.

733
00:35:43,924 --> 00:35:45,831
Tso K, I’m joining this!

734
00:35:45,846 --> 00:35:48,018
You bounce from
side to side like this!

735
00:35:48,026 --> 00:35:50,038
I was hoping to get a massage.

736
00:35:50,064 --> 00:35:51,712
I don’t do massages.

737
00:35:51,714 --> 00:35:54,089
You can’t say no to that—
she’s the Hermana Mayor!

738
00:35:54,089 --> 00:35:55,120
Oh, yes!

739
00:35:55,128 --> 00:35:57,219
That’s a pleasure!

740
00:35:57,220 --> 00:35:59,395
Oh my, Tash, if it weren’t for you…

741
00:35:59,407 --> 00:36:04,796
You know, someone with a trashy
attitude shouldn’t be a queen anyway.

742
00:36:06,136 --> 00:36:07,371
Hey, Tash!

743
00:36:07,395 --> 00:36:09,755
Alright, I’ll be the one
to distract Hannah.

744
00:36:09,760 --> 00:36:15,173
Here in Barangay Singko,
we’re kind and loving.

745
00:36:15,197 --> 00:36:17,646
If Hannah finds out,
you’re on your own, okay?

746
00:36:17,670 --> 00:36:19,226
What is it I need to know?

747
00:36:19,234 --> 00:36:20,668
That you’re like a giant period.
